# LF everywhere: normalized to LF in the repository, and checked out as LF on every
# platform, including Windows. Without the explicit eol, a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) would convert to CRLF on checkout.
#
# Nothing in this repository needs CRLF. Vivado, GHDL, ModelSim, dtc, bootgen and
# Python all read LF regardless of platform, and HW_Acc.dts, shell.json and the .bif
# are consumed on the Kria, where LF is the only sane choice.
* text=auto eol=lf
